// Dense linear algebra in double precision: the vectors and matrices every
// other package in this library is written in terms of, plus the
// factorisations the estimators and the quadratic program need.
//
// The package depends on the standard library only. It sits at the bottom of
// the dependency graph, so the shared `Refused` error lives here too.
//
// Shape mismatches in the elementwise arithmetic are programmer errors and
// abort; the routines that factorise a matrix report `Refused`, because there
// the shape and the conditioning come from data.

import {
  "moonbitlang/core/debug",
}
